<title>FRANCE: Eurocopter, FBS in British helicopter deal.</title>
<headline>Eurocopter, FBS in British helicopter deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franco-German helicopter maker Eurocopter and FBS Ltd have signed a contract to supply 38 Ecureuil single-engine helicopters for use by the British Defence Helicopter Flying School, Eurocopter said on Friday.</p>
<p>Eurocopter is a joint-venture between SNI-Aerospatiale and Daimler-Benz Aerospace AG. FBS is a joint-venture between FR Aviation, Bristow Helicopters Ltd, and Serco Defence Ltd. The helicopters are scheduled to be delivered over a year, starting mid-November.</p>
<p>At the request of the British Defence Ministry, FBS organised its tender around a private funding initiative to ensure cost effectiveness, Eurocopter added.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
